{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "ac35bdacdfa698077064dd5bd22a73ea556a11f87e40eb1a13705b846dc734b6", "ja": "決まり手はセクシー？　ツッパリ対決！", "zh": "致胜招数是性感？突进推掌对决！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8be939544c83a31f0213530f1e096186c04aa9b1d9ff972ba74a39a69f98c419", "ja": "『ツッパリ落としっこ』で連勝する海美。昴\nに仇を取ってくれと頼まれるも風花も敗北し\nてしまうが、試合中のただならぬセクシーさ\nに観客は大盛り上がり。試合には勝ったのに\nなぜか海美は負けた気分を味わうのだった。", "zh": "海美在《互相撞倒》中连胜。虽然受昴所托要为她报仇，但风花也败下阵来，\n观众却因比赛中非同寻常的性感魅力而欢呼不已。明明赢得了比赛，\n海美却不知为何尝到了输掉的滋味。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_02_1000_047sub", "source_sha256": "c7f543e9edf8d0304e6249faffd93fa7e3d03af8eb37732c1179b58ddec47f23", "ja": "うう、悔しい～！　海美、ツッパリ落としっこゲーム\n強すぎ！　もしかして練習してた？", "zh": "呜呜，好不甘心～！海美在互相推倒游戏里也太强了！难道你之前练习过？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_02_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "ac1611f29e8b395a0ef4ba6bc92ed533c0d4f5efa2988aab7d11a86cfc26daca", "ja": "えへへっ！　ゆりりん、歩、なおー、みらいっちときて\nすばるんにも勝利☆　これでツッパリっこ5連勝だね♪", "zh": "嘿嘿！百合子、步、奈绪、未来，还有昴昴，我全都赢啦☆ 这样一来就是推搡对决5连胜了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_02_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "16f3e5535179dad14858473582b219d4273ad6451e89ff115a1cbd3c828de94e", "ja": "次は風花の番だよな？　頼む、風花！\n海美に勝ってオレの仇をとってくれ！", "zh": "接下来该风花上场了吧？拜托了，风花！打败海美，替我报仇！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_02_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "38190a129f516937c8023e20aa896367f938ff84a4ae0c4d2c6efe4b97ceed54", "ja": "うん、任せて！　危なくないように爪も切ったし……\nよ～し、海美ちゃんの連勝は私が止めてみせるねっ！", "zh": "嗯，交给我吧！为了安全指甲也剪过了……\n好～，海美的连胜就由我来终结吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_02_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "4a7e9dc1422330bfe503c9766825058807093b7ceaacf7f957bc27bb95bb67cb", "ja": "誰が相手でも負けないよ～～～っ！\n全力でいくからね、ふーちゃん！！", "zh": "不管对手是谁，我都不会输的——！！！\n我会全力以赴的，风花！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_02_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "558eb5c928022ca3f693317f2511aba09ec6001b493885fa9018b85e2ec679db", "ja": "注目の6戦目！　高坂選手の連勝ストップなるか！？\nレディ～…………、ツッパーリィ！！", "zh": "备受瞩目的第6战！高坂选手的连胜能否就此终结！？  \n预备——……，出——击！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_02_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "2a8dd208bcab98397bb5f2c6b52c335d2475f3d484f75c8536d62622ab51607f", "ja": "先手必勝！　うみみんツッパリ！！\nシュバババババババーーーーン！！", "zh": "先发制人！海美美突张！！\n唰唰唰唰唰——砰！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_02_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "cb228f717263040c4680ffc5fc31dce7a7bae0ee07e034f3c97c09a82005da73", "ja": "うわ、オレもあれでやられたんだよな……！\n頼む風花、耐えてくれ～！", "zh": "哇，我也栽在那招手上了啊……！\n拜托了风花，撑住啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_02_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "233fe8b24e16f0b9a0f353c64c25b0e166a22164a11e380914b986d6e272317a", "ja": "んっ……ああっ……！\nだ、ダメ、これ以上は……、いやぁっ！", "zh": "嗯……啊……！\n不、不行，不能再继续了……呀啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_02_1009_audience", "source_sha256": "9e08e9055675d865f77121f833e12884eb909cd2f57e3076c889e20f3fb71337", "ja": "ウオオオォォォォ！！　風花！！　風花！！　風花！！", "zh": "呜哦哦哦哦哦！！风花！！风花！！风花！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_02_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "0f7359ea3ab733e830f95d2bf33e4fc03a49696f120a28a3ca15130ff5d4c5e1", "ja": "す、すっげー！　なんかわかんないけど、風花の応援が\n超盛り上がってるぜ！　がんばれ風花～！　……あ。", "zh": "好、好厉害！虽然不知道怎么回事，但给风花加油的气氛超热烈的！\n加油啊，风花～！……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_02_1011_se", "source_sha256": "844b11d520a24c6613c3d164e9b2f90ec7fc95ca97858bb969168be8d6f4bb01", "ja": "バッシャーン！", "zh": "哗啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_02_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "20970e0645250bc9b7af09bd2cc81cbc6daf7708cf818fe97c4cacc5beb3e302", "ja": "うう、負けちゃった……。\nごめんね昴ちゃん。仇、とれなくて……。", "zh": "呜呜，输了……  \n对不起，昴，没能替你报仇……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_02_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "1c28d0f78db60971e26204530372654e7c660b95a0bbee98f9d06f5564b512bb", "ja": "いいって。会場はめちゃくちゃ盛り上がってたぜ！\nなんかわかんないけど！", "zh": "没事啦。现场的气氛超级热烈呢！\n虽然我也不太明白为什么就是了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_02_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "0a657a80809f464e029a852de297165f19955723d17b1491b3b4c53f666f43a4", "ja": "う～、おっかしーなぁ。ゲームに勝ったのに、\nなんかふーちゃんには負けた気がする～～っ！", "zh": "呜～，真奇怪啊。明明赢了游戏，\n却总觉得好像输给风花了～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
